exports[`golden email output (env unset) > duplicate refund and iOS overlap > ios overlap no site 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html><html><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f3f1ec">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0">You have an App Store plan and a web plan. Cancel the web plan to stop paying twice.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f3f1ec;padding:24px 12px"><tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:480px;background:#0d0d0d;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif">
<tr><td style="padding:26px 28px 0 28px"><span style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:700;color:#fff">PRIME<span style="color:#f4a100">BARBER</span></span></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 0 28px"><div style="font-size:24px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700;color:#fff">You now pay for Prime Barber twice</div><div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#c9ccd4">You have a Prime Barber plan through the App Store and one on the web. Your shop now runs on your App Store plan, so the web plan no longer adds anything. To stop paying twice, cancel your web plan: sign in, open Settings, then Manage plan.</div></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 28px 0 28px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a2a"><tr><td style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;color:#8b919e;font-size:13px;width:64px;vertical-align:top">Plan</td><td style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;color:#f4f5f8;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap">Bookings</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;color:#8b919e;font-size:13px;width:64px;vertical-align:top">Account</td><td style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;color:#f4f5f8;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap">a@b.co</td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:26px 28px 6px 28px"><a href="https://www.aibarber.org/app/sign-in" style="display:block;text-align:center;background:#f4a100;color:#15130c;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 20px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700">Manage web plan</a></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 26px 28px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6b7280">Forgot your password? <a href="https://www.aibarber.org/app/forgot-password" style="color:#c9ccd4">Reset it</a>. We never email passwords.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "subject": "You now pay for Prime Barber twice",
  "text": "You now pay for Prime Barber twice

You have a Prime Barber plan through the App Store and one on the web. Your shop now runs on your App Store plan, so the web plan no longer adds anything. To stop paying twice, cancel your web plan: sign in, open Settings, then Manage plan.

Plan: Bookings
Account: a@b.co

Manage web plan: https://www.aibarber.org/app/sign-in

Forgot your password? https://www.aibarber.org/app/forgot-password
We never email passwords.",
}
`;

